From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: tom <tompt@seznam.cz>
Date: Thu, 19 Nov 2026 10:53:20 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] soc: apple: rtkit: Return endpoint start send errors

The management send can fail, but apple_rtkit_start_ep() currently returns zero after it. Propagate the send error so application drivers can stop initialization when the firmware could not be sent the endpoint start request.

Assisted-by: LLM
---
 drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c | 4 +---
 1 file changed, 1 insertion(+), 3 deletions(-)

diff --git a/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c b/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c
index b54688f56..ccadd6c4e 100644
--- a/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c
+++ b/drivers/soc/apple/rtkit.c
@@ -676,9 +676,7 @@ int apple_rtkit_start_ep(struct apple_rtkit *rtk, u8 endpoint)
 
 	msg = FIELD_PREP(APPLE_RTKIT_MGMT_STARTEP_EP, endpoint);
 	msg |= APPLE_RTKIT_MGMT_STARTEP_FLAG;
-	apple_rtkit_management_send(rtk, APPLE_RTKIT_MGMT_STARTEP, msg);
-
-	return 0;
+	return apple_rtkit_management_send(rtk, APPLE_RTKIT_MGMT_STARTEP, msg);
 }
 EXPORT_SYMBOL_GPL(apple_rtkit_start_ep);
 
